            <ArticleTitle>Cervical root entrapment.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>719-30</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article reviews the clinical syndromes of neck pain with referred pain, radiculopathy, and myelopathy caused by degenerative disorders of the cervical spine. Cervical spine pathology should be considered as a common cause of symptoms when evaluating with any patient with pain in the upper extremity.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
